msgid "`Hardware Report <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/HardwareReport/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:17
#: 77703c5e16854b7c9dd0dae0538b9b03
msgid "Provides a overview of connected hardware from a parameter file or log. If a log is used, more information can be provided, such as sensor health status and exact firmware version. A range of options are available to extract mission, lua scripts used, and parameters from logs: all, only changed, or minimal removing calibration parameters. Includes visualization for sensor position offsets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:22
#: 5d25301a66164689bdb704dbd2e1a0fe
msgid "`MAGFit <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:23
#: c92af159a4a84ca8900064148cfc98d7
msgid "Used to calibrate or fine tune calibration of compass from flight log. This tool fits the logged magnetometer data to the world magnetic model providing offsets, iron correction, scale, motor compensation and checks for proper orientation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:28
#: 55554543e3e64e7a8902920fcd24cd04
msgid "`Filter Review <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:29
#: 39c5404b94994602b0f67ef9076a7d0a
msgid "Gyro noise and filter configuration tool. Uses raw or batch IMU logs to show the vehicle's noise profile. Filters can be applied to logged pre-filter data to see the effect without the need to fly again. Advanced user tool, more instructions on use coming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:34
#: 6f42608ee4dd419387f18cc5d255d52a
msgid "`Filter Tool <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterTool/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:35
#: 8570e52537a6432db9ee7f2f800b1e6e
msgid "Bode plot tool to give insight into gyro low pass and notch filter setup. This tool visualizes the attenuation and phase lag of a filter setup loaded from a parameter file. For filter setup the FilterReview tool it is recommended it provides the same bode plot feedback. This filter tool allows the attenuation and phase lag of each filter to be plotted individually, something which the filter review tool cannot do. This tool also provides a estimated response for the rate PID gains. Advance user tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:40
#: aab42c383678436191a127a8362dc436
msgid "`PID Review <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/PIDReview/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:41
#: cb6cf7acef05422f9643e2e40b519c27
msgid "Review PID tune in the frequency domain. Step response estimate is generated. Results are split based on parameter changes. Advance user tool."
msgstr ""
